            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/1cc55c1f068998a0e865a116b958344a.poster.avif?t=1780670420\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/1cc55c1f068998a0e865a116b958344a.webm?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/1cc55c1f068998a0e865a116b958344a.mp4?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estamos no ano 2029 e os humanos com melhoramentos mecânicos foram decretados párias e vivem segregados da sociedade. Agora, um agente infiltrado de elite chamado Adam Jensen vê-se forçado a trabalhar num mundo que despreza pessoas como ele. Armado com um arsenal e melhoramentos topo de gama, Adam tem de escolher a abordagem certa e também em quem deve confiar para desvendar uma vasta conspiração mundial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUMANO 2.0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escolhe armas e melhoramentos e personaliza-os de acordo com o teu estilo de jogo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bd355638835ac8be4acd34329774a5d9.poster.avif?t=1780670420\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bd355638835ac8be4acd34329774a5d9.webm?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bd355638835ac8be4acd34329774a5d9.mp4?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NUM FUTURO PRÓXIMO, A HUMANIDADE ESTÁ DIVIDIDA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descobre um futuro próximo onde o destino da humanidade está em jogo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bdd250dcab3b8d2c1b67d97f3172e4b8.poster.avif?t=1780670420\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bdd250dcab3b8d2c1b67d97f3172e4b8.webm?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bdd250dcab3b8d2c1b67d97f3172e4b8.mp4?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCOLHAS E CONSEQUÊNCIAS IMPORTANTES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As decisões que tomas serão cruciais para determinar o final do jogo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/d5cde8a838a4b96150ad25a54fbd466f.poster.avif?t=1780670420\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/d5cde8a838a4b96150ad25a54fbd466f.webm?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/d5cde8a838a4b96150ad25a54fbd466f.mp4?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/1cc55c1f068998a0e865a116b958344a.poster.avif?t=1780670420\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/1cc55c1f068998a0e865a116b958344a.webm?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/1cc55c1f068998a0e865a116b958344a.mp4?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estamos no ano 2029 e os humanos com melhoramentos mecânicos foram decretados párias e vivem segregados da sociedade. Agora, um agente infiltrado de elite chamado Adam Jensen vê-se forçado a trabalhar num mundo que despreza pessoas como ele. Armado com um arsenal e melhoramentos topo de gama, Adam tem de escolher a abordagem certa e também em quem deve confiar para desvendar uma vasta conspiração mundial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUMANO 2.0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escolhe armas e melhoramentos e personaliza-os de acordo com o teu estilo de jogo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bd355638835ac8be4acd34329774a5d9.poster.avif?t=1780670420\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bd355638835ac8be4acd34329774a5d9.webm?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bd355638835ac8be4acd34329774a5d9.mp4?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NUM FUTURO PRÓXIMO, A HUMANIDADE ESTÁ DIVIDIDA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descobre um futuro próximo onde o destino da humanidade está em jogo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bdd250dcab3b8d2c1b67d97f3172e4b8.poster.avif?t=1780670420\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bdd250dcab3b8d2c1b67d97f3172e4b8.webm?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bdd250dcab3b8d2c1b67d97f3172e4b8.mp4?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCOLHAS E CONSEQUÊNCIAS IMPORTANTES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As decisões que tomas serão cruciais para determinar o final do jogo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/d5cde8a838a4b96150ad25a54fbd466f.poster.avif?t=1780670420\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/d5cde8a838a4b96150ad25a54fbd466f.webm?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/d5cde8a838a4b96150ad25a54fbd466f.mp4?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
